OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGenerally
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. Dry for most areas
OL,8,Finitially but with patchy rain and
OL,9,Fmist developing as the night
OL,10,Fprogresses. Light winds. Cool,
OL,11,Fespecially in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cloudy and possibly damp
OL,14,Fstart to the day, with mist and patchy
OL,15,Flight rain. Rain becomes more
OL,16,Fwidespread through the day, before
OL,17,Feasing overnight. Feeling cool with
OL,18,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
