OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure remains dominant. Cloudy,
OL,7,Fwith patchy light rain on Sunday.
OL,8,FSunny spells on Monday and Tuesday,
OL,9,Fonce any morning fog clears. Light
OL,10,Fwinds, breezier on Tuesday,
OL,11,Ftemperatures around normal.
